  "body": "Create five validated 3-axis Haas `.mch` machine files under `assets/machines/` and register them in `posting::MACHINES` (`crates/app/src/posting.rs`).\n\nUse public Haas (`haascnc.com`) specifications only (no HSMWorks or Fusion files):\n- `haas-vf2.mch`: X/Y/Z travel 762 x 406 x 508 mm (`-L..L`), 8,100 rpm, 22.4 kW, `CAT40`, 20 tools, 16,510 mm/min feed, 25,400 mm/min rapid, `rigid_tapping: true`.\n- `haas-vf2ss.mch`: X/Y/Z travel 762 x 406 x 508 mm (`-L..L`), 12,000 rpm, 22.4 kW, `CAT40`, 30 tools, 21,158 mm/min feed, 35,560 mm/min rapid, `rigid_tapping: true`.\n- `haas-mini-mill.mch`: X/Y/Z travel 406 x 356 x 381 mm (`-L..L`), 8,000 rpm, 7.5 kW, `CAT40`, 10 tools, 10,160 mm/min feed and rapid (note base vs legacy/Super spec in the PR), `rigid_tapping: true`.\n- `haas-dt1.mch`: X/Y/Z travel 508 x 406 x 394 mm (`-L..L`), 10,000 rpm, 11.2 kW, `BT30`, 20 tools, 30,480 mm/min feed, 60,960 mm/min rapid, `rigid_tapping: true`.\n- `haas-dm1.mch`: X/Y/Z travel 508 x 406 x 394 mm (`-L..L`), 10,000 rpm, 11.2 kW, `CAT40`, 18 tools, 30,480 mm/min feed, 60,960 mm/min rapid, `rigid_tapping: true`.\n\nFollow `assets/machines/AGENTS.md` and `docs/MACHINE-ONBOARDING.md`:\n- Write strict JSON with no `//` comments.\n- Set linear `safe_retract` to `0.0` on Z (top home).\n- Set `default_holder` to `\"CAT40 ER32\"` on 40-taper models and `\"BT30 ER32\"` (or `\"BT30 ER20\"`) on `DT-1` (`crates/tools/src/holder_library.rs:323-341`).\n- State coolants (`Flood` `M8`, and optional `Air` `M73`/`M83` or `Through-tool` `M88` if enabled cleanly per model).\n- Add `crates/app/tests/haas_machines.rs` following `tormach_machines.rs`.\n\nDone means: All five Haas `.mch` files parse, validate, appear in the machine picker, and pass limit tests in `crates/app/tests/haas_machines.rs`.\n\nPart of #1961\n",
